        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brainkilled – A Puzzle Game That Stays In Your Head</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’re smart? Good.<br>You’ll need patience more than confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brainkilled</strong> is a minimalist puzzle experience built for players who enjoy being stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t rush through levels.<br>You will stare.<br>You will try ideas.<br>You will close the game.<br>And hours later… the solution might hit you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Modes. One Brain.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Logic &amp; Observation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues can be hidden anywhere:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In what is not being said</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level requires you to <strong>discover the correct password</strong> to proceed.<br>Padlocks reveal the format — but never the answer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔢 The Math Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not pattern matching.<br>Not guessing.<br>Real mathematical reasoning — from accessible concepts to genuinely demanding problems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed For A Specific Type Of Player</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No step-by-step guidance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No artificial difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just structured problems and the satisfaction of finally breaking them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles won’t let you go.<br>That’s the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the patience to survive… or will you get Brainkilled?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brainkilled – A Puzzle Game That Stays In Your Head</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’re smart? Good.<br>You’ll need patience more than confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brainkilled</strong> is a minimalist puzzle experience built for players who enjoy being stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t rush through levels.<br>You will stare.<br>You will try ideas.<br>You will close the game.<br>And hours later… the solution might hit you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Modes. One Brain.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Logic &amp; Observation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues can be hidden anywhere:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In what is not being said</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level requires you to <strong>discover the correct password</strong> to proceed.<br>Padlocks reveal the format — but never the answer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔢 The Math Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not pattern matching.<br>Not guessing.<br>Real mathematical reasoning — from accessible concepts to genuinely demanding problems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed For A Specific Type Of Player</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No step-by-step guidance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No artificial difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just structured problems and the satisfaction of finally breaking them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles won’t let you go.<br>That’s the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the patience to survive… or will you get Brainkilled?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
